  "theorem_statement": "The firewall closure square is the mod-12/toroidal factorization of the same q=3 carrier. The affine triads are kq=36, the firewall grid is q^2=9, and the cubic total is kq+q^2=45=Jq^2. Orientation gives 2kq=72 roots; adding rank 2q gives E6=78, while adding firewall q^2 gives H1=q^4=81. On the torus side Phi6=N(q-1,1)=7 generates edges qPhi6=21, flag orbits 2qPhi6=42, and flags kPhi6=84.",
